# API Contract

- Source of truth: `docs/API-CONTRACT.md`.
- `document_type`: lab | ultrasound | prescription | other.
- Breaking changes → `/v2`.
- Errors: `{ error: { code, message, request_id } }`.
- Bắt buộc có `usage` khi gọi AI (P2.09).
